"""Inline brand marks for the Connectors UI.

Source: Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), licensed CC0 1.0, fetched once from
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.34.0/icons/<slug>.svg (version 16.34.0).
Only the path ``d`` attribute and brand hex are kept; nothing is fetched at runtime.

Brands without a usable mark fall back to a lettermark (feishu, dingtalk, webhook).
Slack, Microsoft Teams and Microsoft Outlook still ship icon files but are absent from
Simple Icons' data file, so their hex colors are the well-known brand colors.
``wecom`` reuses the WeChat mark because Simple Icons has no separate WeCom slug.
"""
